TASK 1: TO-DO LIST APPLICATION

Description:
A command-line To-Do List application developed using Python. It helps
users manage their daily tasks.

Features:
- Add a new task
- View all tasks and their status
- Update an existing task
- Mark a task as completed
- Delete a task
- Save tasks in a JSON file so they remain available after the program
  is closed

Requirement:
Python 3

How to run:
1. Open a terminal in this folder.
2. Run: python CODSOFT_TASK1.py
3. Follow the menu displayed in the terminal.

Storage:
The application creates a tasks.json file in the current working
directory to store task information.
